    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1754303563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1754303563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1754303563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/ca4096431f1f3e5e5f4fc49be13584c8.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Maid Slaves &amp; Golden Dungeon&quot; is a short adult Roguelite game developed by nikukyu and published by 072 Project.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/82ef9eeb4a8ba1a467f29fb2a78c6662.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span>By chance, the general who was captured became a prisoner of war in the enemy country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also obtained the slave rights of her and made her a maid, but we have a bad relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I really miss the time when I lived in poverty and worried about my future life alone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her cold expression back then has become much softer now,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While saying, &quot;&quot;Master, when do you wake up? You said you wanted to go to the dungeon today, right?&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And she woke me up with a &quot;blow&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few years after that terrible encounter, today, I go to the dungeon to earn money with the former general who now is my maid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/dd5b0f7447079b90f522c6219d707b8f.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/5254425b2f13cb7f5890e2530edb47ad.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No troublesome mechanics</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to repeatedly fight monsters to level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even escape from monsters if you don't want to fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just enhance your weapons to increase your stats,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and gain powerful skills at the same time!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite dungeon design</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both resources and treasures are randomly generated,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >every time you enter the dungeon, you have a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique hunger and thirst system</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare hunger and thirst system in RPGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before entering the dungeon, you need to check if you have enough food and water,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, you might starve to death in the dungeon!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/0b7a0eb7b4a8fe46ee30f510a7aa4cf4.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span>Once you come to your senses, you will live a happy and sex life with your maid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in order to free Leia, you must find a way to earn 1 million in this 60 floors dungeon!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the dungeon, in addition to fighting monsters and gathering resources, you also need to be careful of your hunger and thirst with Ria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One careless mistake and you might have to start exploring from the first level again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you gather the equipment, you can collect valuable resources in deeper levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are working hard to earn money, there may be various &quot;rewards&quot; waiting for you?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/85766d98dd886f3bf666fd814230a901.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/83793ce3b4f2a6b7ab093a686d8b200c.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/0257807d5e241a36d08726a38b982c19.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullscreen mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key settings / joystick settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide dialogue box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene recollection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG recollection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger value / Thirst value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon enhancement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/ca4096431f1f3e5e5f4fc49be13584c8.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Maid Slaves &amp; Golden Dungeon&quot; is a short adult Roguelite game developed by nikukyu and published by 072 Project.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/82ef9eeb4a8ba1a467f29fb2a78c6662.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span>By chance, the general who was captured became a prisoner of war in the enemy country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also obtained the slave rights of her and made her a maid, but we have a bad relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I really miss the time when I lived in poverty and worried about my future life alone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her cold expression back then has become much softer now,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While saying, &quot;&quot;Master, when do you wake up? You said you wanted to go to the dungeon today, right?&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And she woke me up with a &quot;blow&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few years after that terrible encounter, today, I go to the dungeon to earn money with the former general who now is my maid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.