y to earn 1 million in this 60 floors dungeon!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the dungeon, in addition to fighting monsters and gathering resources, you also need to be careful of your hunger and thirst with Ria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One careless mistake and you might have to start exploring from the first level again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you gather the equipment, you can collect valuable resources in deeper levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are working hard to earn money, there may be various &quot;rewards&quot; waiting for you?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/85766d98dd886f3bf666fd814230a901.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/83793ce3b4f2a6b7ab093a686d8b200c.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514850/extras/0257807d5e241a36d08726a38b982c19.avif?t=1754303563\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullscreen mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key settings / joystick settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide dialogue box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene recollection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG recollection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger value / Thirst value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon enhancement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "After the war, the enemy general &quot;Ria&quot; unexpectedly becomes your slave!? In order to help the enslaved maid Ria regain her freedom, you must earn one million in the dungeon. Little did you know, you would end up living a sweet life in the dungeon...",
